<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Paper C · Learner paper</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-1/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 1 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Paper C · Learner paper</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace to practise with section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need manual review.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><nav class="links"><a href="#listening">Listening</a><a href="#reading">Reading</a><a href="#writing">Writing</a><a href="#speaking">Speaking</a></nav><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="listening">Listening · 15 minutes</h2><h3>L1 · Questions 1–5</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q1"><h3>1. Who helps the speaker practise Chinese?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m01.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 弟弟</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 妈妈</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q2"><h3>2. Who will go with the speaker to visit Grandmother?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m02.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 爷爷</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q3"><h3>3. Whose birthday is it today?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m03.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 姐姐</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 爸爸</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q4"><h3>4. In which city does the speaker live now?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m04.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上海</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 北京</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 天津</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q5"><h3>5. Which subject is the FIRST lesson on Monday?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m05.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 数学</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中文</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 体育</div></div></article></div><h3>L2 · Questions 6–10</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q6"><h3>6. What is in the red box?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m06.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 铅笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 橡皮</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 尺子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q7"><h3>7. Where should the student write the answers?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m07.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 书上</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑板上</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 本子上</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q8"><h3>8. Whose book has been found?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m08.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 女同学</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q9"><h3>9. Which item do students NOT need to bring themselves?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m09.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 水</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 毛巾</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q10"><h3>10. When does the Chinese lesson END?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m10.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点四十</div></div></article></div><h3>L3 · Questions 11–15</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q11"><h3>11. What does the customer ask for?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m11.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 热汤</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 凉汤</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 冷水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q12"><h3>12. Where will the customer eat the lunch?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m12.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 店里</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 家里</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 学校</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q13"><h3>13. Which fruit does the speaker buy for herself?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m13.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 西瓜</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 苹果</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 橙子</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q14"><h3>14. What is the TOTAL price including the egg?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m14.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 十块</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八块</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 两块</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q15"><h3>15. Which size does the customer finally choose?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m15.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 中号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大号</div></div></article></div><h3>L4 · Questions 16–20</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q16"><h3>16. What is the FINAL meeting time?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m16.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午三点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午两点半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q17"><h3>17. When does the BUS leave?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m17.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 九点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 八点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点四十</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q18"><h3>18. What color should the TROUSERS be?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m18.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 白色</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 黑色</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 蓝色</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q19"><h3>19. What can the speaker do?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m19.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 弹钢琴</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 唱歌</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 画画</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q20"><h3>20. What will the boy do TODAY after school?</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/c1c-m20.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Single-play review clip. The timed full track plays this source twice.</p><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 游泳</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 跳舞</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 看书</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="reading">Reading · 20 minutes</h2><h3>R1 · Questions 21–25</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q21"><h3>21. What do the writer’s FRIENDS call the writer?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫陈乐。老师在学校叫我陈乐，朋友们喜欢叫我“小树”。我喜欢在树下看书，也喜欢和朋友打球。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小陈</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 陈乐</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小树</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q22"><h3>22. Who washes the dishes?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我叫小米。每天晚饭后，爷爷把桌子擦干净，我去洗碗，姐姐把椅子放好。妈妈说，大家一起做就很快。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 爷爷</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小米</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q23"><h3>23. Who is this letter addressed to?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">奶奶您好：<br>谢谢您送我的书。我每天晚上都看。星期天我和妈妈去您家吃午饭，想听您讲以前的故事。<br>孙女 小雨</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 奶奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妈妈</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 姐姐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q24"><h3>24. Who has NOT started school yet?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我们家三个孩子。哥哥在大学读书，我在湖光学校上学。妹妹还没上学，每天和奶奶在家。明年她也要去学校了。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 哥哥</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 妹妹</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 说话的人</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q25"><h3>25. Who will teach Chinese on TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">班级通知<br>王老师星期二请假。那天林老师来上中文课，时间和教室不变。星期三王老师回来。请同学们带好中文书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 王老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 刘老师</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 林老师</div></div></article></div><h3>R2 · Questions 26–30</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q26"><h3>26. Who should receive students’ homework FIRST?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">同学们：<br>星期三上课前，请把作业本交给小何。小何收好以后送到老师办公室。小林负责拿新本子。不要把作业放在讲台上。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 老师</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q27"><h3>27. What is DIRECTLY opposite the school gate?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">从学校大门往前看：<br>左边是食堂，右边是办公室，大门对面是图书馆。图书馆后面是教室，新同学请先到办公室。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 食堂</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 办公室</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 图书馆</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q28"><h3>28. Which activity is allowed INSIDE the reading room?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">阅览室小提示<br>这里可以安静看书，不可以吃东西，也不要大声说话。手机请关声音，放进包里。出去吃完东西以后可以再进来。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 安静看书</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 吃东西</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 大声说话</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q29"><h3>29. Who owns the RED SCHOOLBAG?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">放学后留下的东西<br>蓝帽子：小林。<br>红书包：小何。<br>黑外套：小康。<br>都放在老师桌子下面，请明天来拿。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 小林</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 小何</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 小康</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q30"><h3>30. When does the SINGING activity start?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本周放学后的安排<br>周一15:00：画画。<br>周四15:30：唱歌。<br>周五14:00：看书。<br>每次活动一个小时，请提前五分钟到。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 周一下午三点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 周五下午两点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 周四下午三点半</div></div></article></div><h3>R3 · Questions 31–35</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q31"><h3>31. Which set includes RICE and VEGETABLES?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">今日午饭<br>一号：米饭和青菜。<br>二号：面条和牛肉。<br>三号：包子和鸡肉。<br>每份都有一杯热水，请先选好再点餐。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 一号</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 二号</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 三号</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q32"><h3>32. Which drink should Xiaolu BUY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陆：<br>家里的茶还有很多，水也够。牛奶已经喝完了，请今天买两盒牛奶回来。不要买别的饮料。<br>妈妈</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 茶</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 牛奶</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 水</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q33"><h3>33. At which time can you buy BREAKFAST on Monday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">小店营业时间<br>早餐：早上七点到九点半。<br>午饭：上午十一点开始。<br>九点半到十一点不卖饭，只卖水。周日不开门。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 上午十点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 上午十一点</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 上午九点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q34"><h3>34. At which window should a customer collect HOT TEA?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">取餐提示<br>一号窗口取米饭，二号窗口取面条，三号窗口取饮料。热茶和牛奶也在三号窗口，请带好小票。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 三号窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 一号窗口</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 二号窗口</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q35"><h3>35. How many pairs of SOCKS should be packed?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">去奶奶家住两天<br>请带：上衣两件，裤子一条，袜子三双。<br>奶奶家有毛巾，不用带。把干净衣服放在蓝色包里。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 两双</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 三双</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 一双</div></div></article></div><h3>R4 · Questions 36–40</h3><div class="question-grid"><article class="item" id="q36"><h3>36. When does the film start according to the NEW ticket?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周六看电影<br>旧票：下午四点开始。<br>新票：下午五点开始，四点半可以进去。<br>小田说：请带新票，别拿旧票。地点没有变。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 下午四点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 下午四点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 下午五点</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q37"><h3>37. When does the writer get up on SUNDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">我平时六点半起床，七点吃早饭。星期天不用上学，我八点才起床，八点半和爸爸一起吃早饭，然后看书。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 八点</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 六点半</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 八点半</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q38"><h3>38. Which shoes are requested for TUESDAY?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">本周穿衣提示<br>周二体育课：运动鞋。<br>周三唱歌表演：黑色皮鞋。<br>老师说，鞋子要干净，别把两天的安排记错。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 黑色皮鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 运动鞋</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 拖鞋</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q39"><h3>39. What is the NEW activity on Sunday?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">周日活动改了：<br>因为下雨，不去公园打篮球了。我们下午三点在小方家听音乐。时间不变，想来的朋友请给小方发消息。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 去公园</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 打篮球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 听音乐</div></div></article><article class="item" id="q40"><h3>40. What should participants BRING for the drawing activity?</h3><div class="material"><p class="cn">画画小组<br>周六上午九点在公园见。请自己带纸和笔，老师带颜色。画完后大家可以看别人的画，不用准备食物。</p></div><div class="options"><div class="option cn"><b>A.</b> 纸和笔</div><div class="option cn"><b>B.</b> 球</div><div class="option cn"><b>C.</b> 食物</div></div></article></div><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="writing">Writing · 15 minutes</h2><p>Both tasks share 15 minutes. Write on paper or in your own text editor. This review page does not save answers.</p><section class="box" id="W1"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W1</p><h2>Reply to an outdoor drawing invitation</h2><p>Reply in Chinese to your classmate. Say whether you can join the Sunday drawing activity, give a time or another day that works, and ask one question about the activity. About 20-40 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. You may invent your schedule.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">小陆：你好！周日下午一起去公园画画，好吗？你一点还是两点有空？<br>小陶</p></div><ul><li>Respond to the Sunday invitation.</li><li>Give a workable time or an alternative day.</li><li>Ask one question relevant to the drawing activity.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="W2"><p class="eyebrow">writing · W2</p><h2>Introduce a student and a Tuesday lesson</h2><p>Use BOTH parts of the fictional information below to introduce Chen Miao in Chinese. Include name and age, school and the Tuesday class starting time, and at least one preference. About 40-70 Chinese characters is a guide, not a minimum. Simple connected sentences are enough.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">学生卡<br>陈苗，十五岁，湖光学校。<br>喜欢：跳舞、牛奶。不喜欢：茶。<br><br>周二上午课表<br>9:15—10:00：中文课。<br>10:15—11:00：数学课。</p></div><ul><li>Identify Chen Miao by name and age.</li><li>Give the school and the Chinese lesson starting time on Tuesday.</li><li>State at least one preference consistent with the card.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><h2 class="sectiontitle" id="speaking">Speaking · 10 minutes</h2><section class="box" id="S1"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S1</p><h2>Talk about school and make a plan</h2><p>Answer four recorded prompts in Chinese. Each plays twice, followed by 10 seconds to prepare and up to 20 seconds to record. Real or invented details are acceptable. All four responses form ONE /8 task. These are fixed prompts, not an adaptive conversation.</p><p>A classmate asks about your school, clothing preferences and weekend routine, then invites you to sing together.</p><h3>Prompt S1-1</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-1.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-2</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-2.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-3</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-3.mp3"></audio><h3>Prompt S1-4</h3><audio controls preload="none" src="assets/audio/s1-4.mp3"></audio><p class="note">Each audio prompt plays twice. After it ends, allow 10 seconds to prepare and 20 seconds to record using your own recording app. Four responses = one task /8.</p><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section><section class="box" id="S2"><p class="eyebrow">speaking · S2</p><h2>Describe a student’s Tuesday</h2><p>Use the fictional note to describe Xu Xing’s Tuesday in Chinese. Include who the student is, the school and at least one class time, and the after-school activity. You have 60 seconds to prepare and up to 60 seconds to speak. No minimum recording length is enforced.</p><div class="material"><p class="cn">许星的周二<br>学校：湖光学校<br>7:45：到学校<br>8:10：开始上课<br>12:00：和朋友吃午饭<br>16:30：下课<br>下课后：在音乐教室和同学唱歌</p></div><ul><li>Identify Xu Xing.</li><li>Give the school and at least one class time.</li><li>Describe the after-school activity in the note.</li></ul><p class="badge">Manual /8 · no automatic grade</p><p class="note">Missing responses stay unsubmitted; technical failures need rerecording. Suggested length is not a hard minimum.</p></section></main></body></html>